  "Welcome back to The Sound Above. I am Mike Hall. Today we enter The AI Horizon & The Observable Control Plane. Before code synthesis models and automated agents, developers met face to face to establish standards of craftsmanship. Today we rewatch Episode 37: Community Panel & Open Roundtable from Live Stream Roundtable (2026).",
  "An open invitational panel bringing together original Chicago organizers, apprentices, and modern platform engineers.",
  "What is the permanent legacy of the Software Craftsmanship movement? What will we pass down to the generation learning to code in 2030? What principles guided Community Panel & Open Roundtable when this conversation was recorded? How do those lessons inform the software systems we design today?",
  "Roll archive footage (YouTube ID: ). Watch for the unvarnished hallway exchanges, the emphasis on craft over speed, and the sheer enthusiasm of engineers taking responsibility for their software.",
